      "text": [
        " رِوَايَةِ هِشَامِ بْنِ سَالِمٍ عَنْ أَبِي عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ قَالَ : \"دِرْهَمٌ رِبًا أَشَدُّ عِنْدَ اَللَّهِ مِنْ سَبْعِينَ زَنْيَةً كُلِّهَا بِذَاتِ مَحْرَمٍ \"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.3992 - In a narration from Hisham ibn Salim, from Abu Abdullah (as), he said:\n\"One dirham of usury is more severe in the sight of Allah (swt) than seventy acts of fornication, all of which are committed with forbidden relatives.\""
        ]
      }
